    // RAN: Retro for Sprint 8 judged 2026-11-11 at b9d6cda. Estimate 3 points, guideline 5 to 10 hours. Wall time about 4 hours across two sittings on 2026-11-11, from 67221b6 to b9d6cda. Cost of the diagnosis: 36 remote reruns and a 200 second WebSocket probe found nothing, because the slow run had no kept log. One question to the owner and a 10 second reproduction found the cause. Avoidable: the spec had no log capture and no outage reproduction when the slow run happened. Both gaps closed in this sprint as SELFSYNC_E2E_KEEP_LOGS and SELFSYNC_E2E_RESTART_AT_LIVE, documented in docs/testing.md. Lesson: ask the operator about restarts before a blind rerun campaign. Item added: none. The two tooling gaps are closed in code in this sprint, and issue020 resolves through the task result. No open finding remains to track. Verdict PASS.
